OL,3,GNEWSAFather and son's 'cheeky' cut-out 
OL,4,Abook wins prize                        
OL,6,FA father and son have won the          
OL,7,FWaterstones Children's Book of the Year
OL,8,Fafter being inspired as they enjoyed an
OL,9,Farts and crafts evening at home.       
OL,11,FDan Ojari and his eight-year-old son   
OL,12,FFinn, from Bristol, created Is This a  
OL,13,FPlum? after "drawing, thinking and     
OL,14,Flaughing" about what some shapes look  
OL,15,Flike.                                  
OL,17,FOjari said he realised that "a plum    
OL,18,Flooks a lot like a hippo's bum" and it 
OL,19,Fled to the pair creating a book filled 
OL,20,Fwith "visual tricks and rhyming        
OL,21,Freveals".                              
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
